# Source: this directory

This component's source is here. It is edited in place and committed to the
installer repository. There is no upstream to re-vendor from, and re-vendoring is
not a maintenance action for it any more.

archived-upstream: private repository, smart-node-core
archived-on: 2026-08-15
last-upstream-commit: 1fa3f42 (2026-08-14)

Why: the separate repository and this copy were two sources for one program, and
for a month every change landed here while the repository stood still. Rather than
keep a second place nobody writes to but which looks primary, the repository is
ARCHIVED -- read-only, still clonable, still holding anything never brought
across.

Vendored from the repository's frontend/ directory, NOT from the retired
smart-node-ui, which is 1431 lines away and archived as well.

